            </note>
            <note corresp="#d643-f2" n="2" xml:id="d643-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram Secto 332, May 28, contained the
                        U.K. proposal presented to the Drafting
                    Committee on Indochina. (396.1 GE/5–2854) For minutes of the meeting of this
                    committee, May 28, and the text of the British proposal, see <ref
                        target="#pg955">p. 955</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d643-f3" n="3" xml:id="d643-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram Secto 333, May 28, contained the
                    summary minutes of the first meeting of the Drafting Committee on Indochina.
                    (396.1 GE/5–2854) For minutes of this meeting, May 28, see <ref target="#pg955"
                        >p. 955</ref>.</p>
            </note>
